graph TD
    Start([User submits research question]) --> Supervisor{Supervisor Agent}

    Supervisor -->|dispatch| Search[Search Agent<br/>Tavily Web Search]
    Supervisor -->|dispatch| Paper[Paper Agent<br/>Semantic Scholar API]

    Search --> Join[Aggregate Results<br/>into Shared State]
    Paper --> Join

    Join --> Analysis[Analysis Agent<br/>Extract & rank key findings]

    Analysis --> Decision{Supervisor:<br/>Enough evidence?}
    Decision -->|Gaps found, re-query| Supervisor
    Decision -->|Sufficient| Synthesis[Synthesis Agent<br/>Write cited report]

    Synthesis --> End([Final Report<br/>with inline citations])

    style Supervisor fill:#4A90D9,color:#fff
    style Decision fill:#4A90D9,color:#fff
    style Search fill:#50C878,color:#fff
    style Paper fill:#50C878,color:#fff
    style Analysis fill:#F5A623,color:#fff
    style Synthesis fill:#D0021B,color:#fff
